## Retained fixture and remaining limits

`/Game/_MCP_Temp/SkeletalSections/SectionSmoke_20260921_1353` is retained,
saved clean and restored to all sections enabled. Production mesh files were
not edited. No commit or push was performed.

No multi-chunk fixture or interactive Undo/Redo test was run; those paths were
checked against the native mesh editor source. Full verification remains blocked
by the unrelated workspace portability failure. The fixture's dependency audit
does not substitute for a packaged-game test.

